 "Craftmjne (the game) - always at the bottom": "Craftmjne（遊戲）——始終在最底層",
 "Higher wins. A pack can retexture a mod and a mod can override a pack, depending on where they sit.\nAuto puts add-ons after the mods they build on and keeps global packs on top.\nPacks reorder at once; a mod's data order applies the next time the world is opened.": "越靠上越優先。資源包可以重繪模組的貼圖，模組也可以覆蓋資源包，取決於它們的位置。\n自動會把附加包放在它們所依賴的模組之後，並讓全域性資源包保持在頂部。\n資源包會立即重新排序；模組的資料順序在下次開啟世界時生效。",
